{"type":"text","timestamp":1788391760336,"sessionID":"ses_f9b8de4f9ffeurXxuFIsY55WcN","part":{"id":"prt_0647490070014I6rI4Yc97spIG","messageID":"msg_06474890f001AdWTl9rukYT1H6","sessionID":"ses_f9b8de4f9ffeurXxuFIsY55WcN","type":"text","text":"Build, vet, and tests all pass. \n\nSummary of what was created in `/workspace`:\n\n- `main.go` — entrypoint, HTTP server with `-addr`/`-db` flags\n- `handler.go` — REST handlers using Go 1.22 `net/http` method-pattern routing (`GET /books/{id}` etc.), JSON helpers, validation\n- `store.go` — `Book` type, validation, SQLite `Store` with CRUD + author filter\n- `errors.go` — `ErrNotFound`\n- `util.go` — small id helper\n- `handler_test.go` — 4 tests covering full create→get→list(filter)→delete lifecycle, input validation, health check, and update (incl. 404)\n- `go.mod` / `go.sum` — uses `modernc.org/sqlite` (pure-Go, no CGO)\n- `README.md` — setup, run, endpoint table, examples\n\nRun with `go run .` (listens on `:8080`, `books.db`), tests via `go test ./...`.","time":{"start":1788391755783,"end":1788391760331}}}
